        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-12-26/pdf/2024-31143.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 5. General Provisions. (a) Nothing in this order shall be construed \nto impair or otherwise affect:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2015,
      "char_start": 1920,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14129#sec5-i",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(i)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14129#sec5-i",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "89 FR 104857, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2cdbd85bcaa3453cd5ac38b358dff867202c002b85e53dcb2695d8154fd26254",
        "signing_date": "2024-12-18",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14129.txt",
        "text_sha256": "feae0178ff1d0dc60b2333d62a352b8f24fc994c3dd08bb2abf908bb6fdcc0c8",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-12-26/pdf/2024-31143.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(i) the authority granted by law to an executive department or agency, \nor the head thereof; or"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2156,
      "char_start": 2017,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14129#sec5-i-ii",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "(ii)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14129#sec5-i-ii",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "89 FR 104857, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2cdbd85bcaa3453cd5ac38b358dff867202c002b85e53dcb2695d8154fd26254",
        "signing_date": "2024-12-18",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14129.txt",
