        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-12-26/pdf/2024-31143.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) This order shall be implemented consistent with applicable law and \nsubject to the availability of appropriations. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:48 Dec 23, 2024 Jkt 265001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\26DEE0.SGM 26DEE0ddrumheller on DSK120RN23PROD with PRESDOC-E0\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n104858 Federal Register / Vol. 89, No. 247 / Thursday, December 26, 2024 / Presidential Documents"
    },
